<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header class="header">
            <div class="heading-container">
                <h1 class="heading">The Big Five</h1>
                <h1 class="heading">Personality Test</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="result" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
                <h4>
                    RESULTS FOR: <b>
                        <%= answer.user_name %>
                    </b>
                </h4>
                <!-- <p class="description" style="font-size: 12px;">Jan 18, 2021 -8:37AM</p> -->
                <p class="description" style="font-size: 12px;">
                    <%= answer.formattedDate %>
                </p>
            </div>
        </header>

        <section style="margin: 10px 50px 50px 50px;">
            <div>
                <h2 class=" vertical-space">
                    The Five Factors of Personality
                </h2>
                <p>
                    We will begin by looking at the five factors of
                    personality in detail. For each,
                    we’ll explain how scores obtained manifest in your daily
                    activities. You’ll
                    see your own scores for all five factors and how they
                    compare with average
                    scores for all people who took the test.

                </p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h3 class=" vertical-space">
                    Openness
                </h3>
                <p class="bottom-extra-space">
                    Refers to the extent to which individuals are open to
                    new experiences, ideas, and values.
                    It reflects a person's intellectual curiosity,
                    creativity, and receptivity to novel concepts.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Individuals who score <b>high in Openness</b> tend to
                    exhibit certain characteristic traits and behaviors that
                    distinguish them from those who score lower on this
                    personality dimension. Here are some key points about
                    people high in Openness:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li class="list-item"><b>Curiosity and Interest in
                            Novelty: </b>High Openness individuals are
                        characterized by their insatiable curiosity and
                        interest in novel ideas, experiences, and
                        perspectives. They often seek out new and
                        unconventional ways of thinking and may enjoy
                        exploring diverse topics and concepts.
                    </li>
                    <li class="list-item"><b>Imagination and
                            Creativity:</b> People high in Openness possess
                        rich inner lives and vivid imaginations. They are
                        often highly creative and may express themselves
                        through various artistic outlets such as writing,
                        painting, music, or design. They enjoy engaging in
                        imaginative activities and may have a penchant for
                        exploring abstract concepts.
                    </li>
                    <li class="list-item"><b>Adventurous Spirit:</b> High
                        Openness individuals have an adventurous spirit and
                        a willingness to explore new territories, both
                        literally and metaphorically. They may enjoy
                        traveling to unfamiliar places, trying new foods,
                        and immersing themselves in different cultures and
                        experiences.</li>
                    <li class="list-item"><b>Flexibility and
                            Adaptability:</b> Individuals high in Openness
                        are flexible in their thinking and adaptable to
                        change. They are open-minded and receptive to new
                        information and ideas, and they may readily adjust
                        their beliefs and perspectives based on new evidence
                        or experiences.
                    </li>
                    <li class="list-item"><b>Appreciation of Beauty and
                            Aesthetics:</b> High Openness individuals have a
                        deep appreciation for beauty, whether in art,
                        nature, music, or literature. They are often drawn
                        to aesthetic experiences and may derive pleasure
                        from exploring the beauty and complexity of the
                        world around them</li>
                    <li class="list-item"><b>Intellectual Engagement:</b>
                        People high in Openness are intellectually engaged
                        and enjoy engaging in deep, meaningful
                        conversations. They may seek out opportunities for
                        intellectual stimulation and may enjoy debating
                        ideas and concepts with others.</li>
                    <li class="list-item"><b>Tolerance for Ambiguity: </b>
                        High Openness individuals are comfortable with
                        ambiguity and uncertainty. They are less threatened
                        by ambiguity and are more willing to tolerate and
                        even embrace the complexities and uncertainties of
                        life.</li>
                    <li class="list-item"><b>Openness to Experience:</b>
                        Overall, high Openness individuals are open to new
                        experiences and perspectives. They approach life
                        with a sense of wonder and curiosity, constantly
                        seeking to expand their horizons and deepen their
                        understanding of the world.</li>

                </ul>
                <p class="description">
                    It's important to note that while high Openness is
                    associated with many positive traits, it is just one
                    aspect of a person's personality, and individuals may
                    possess a combination of traits from all five major
                    personality dimensions.
                </p>

                <p class="top-extra-space">
                    Individuals<b> low in Openness </b> tend to exhibit
                    certain characteristic traits and behaviors that
                    contrast with those who are high in Openness. Here are
                    some key points about people low in Openness:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li class="list-item"><b>Preference for Familiarity:</b> People low in Openness often prefer
                        familiarity and routine over new experiences and
                        novelty. They may feel more comfortable in
                        predictable environments where they know what to
                        expect.
                    </li>
                    <li class="list-item"><b>Resistance to Change: </b>
                        Individuals low in Openness may be resistant to
                        change and may struggle with adapting to new
                        situations or ideas. They may prefer stability and
                        predictability in their lives and may find change
                        unsettling or anxiety-provoking.
                    </li>
                    <li class="list-item"><b>Limited Interest in
                            Intellectual Pursuits:</b> People low in Openness
                        may have less interest in intellectual pursuits and
                        may not actively seek out new knowledge or ideas.
                        They may be less likely to engage in activities that
                        stimulate their curiosity or challenge their
                        thinking.</li>
                    <li class="list-item"><b>Concrete
                            Thinking:</b> Individuals low in Openness tend to
                        be more concrete in their thinking and may prefer
                        practical, straightforward solutions to problems.
                        They may be less inclined to engage in abstract or
                        speculative thinking and may prioritize practicality
                        over creativity.
                    </li>
                    <li class="list-item"><b>Traditional Values:</b> People
                        low in Openness may value tradition and
                        conventionality, preferring established norms and
                        values over unconventional or avant-garde ideas.
                        They may feel more comfortable adhering to familiar
                        customs and social norms.</li>
                    <li class="list-item"><b>Less Aesthetic
                            Sensitivity:</b> Individuals low in Openness
                        may have less sensitivity to aesthetic experiences
                        and may not derive as much pleasure from art, music,
                        or literature compared to those high in Openness.
                        They may have more conservative tastes in
                        aesthetics.</li>
                    <li class="list-item"><b>Closed-mindedness:</b> People
                        low in Openness may exhibit closed-mindedness and
                        may be less receptive to new ideas or perspectives
                        that challenge their existing beliefs or worldview.
                        They may be more prone to prejudice or intolerance
                        towards those who are different from them.</li>
                    <li class="list-item"><b>Narrow Range of Interests: </b>
                        Individuals low in Openness may have a narrower
                        range of interests and may be less inclined to
                        explore new hobbies or activities outside their
                        comfort zone. They may prefer to stick to familiar
                        activities and routines.</li>

                </ul>
                <p class="description bottom-extra-space">
                    It's important to note that personality traits exist on
                    a continuum, and individuals may exhibit varying degrees
                    of Openness depending on the context and situation.
                    Additionally, being low in Openness does not imply
                    inferiority; rather, it reflects a different set of
                    preferences and tendencies in how individuals approach
                    the world around them.
                </p>
                <div class="chart-container heart-line"> <canvas id="hearthorizontalline" width="400"></canvas>
                </div>
                <!-- section-4 -->
                <div>
                    <p class="top-extra-space"><b>For you:</b></p>
                    <%if(answer.factor_variant.HO>=answer.factor_variant.LO){%>
                        <p class="description">
                            As a person <b>high in openness</b> you are a
                            vibrant
                            soul with an insatiable curiosity and a
                            boundless imagination. From an early age, you
                            have been captivated by the wonders of the world
                            around you, finding beauty and inspiration in
                            every corner of existence.<br />
                            Your mind is a tapestry of ideas, constantly
                            weaving together threads of creativity and
                            innovation. You approach life with an open heart
                            and an open mind, embracing the richness of
                            diversity and the endless possibilities that lie
                            beyond the horizon. Every conversation is an
                            adventure, a journey into the realms of thought
                            and imagination. You find delights in exploring
                            the depths of human experience, delving into the
                            mysteries of the universe, and unraveling the
                            complexities of the human soul. Art is your
                            language, your way of expressing the ineffable
                            beauty that surrounds us. Whether through
                            painting, writing, or music, you channel your
                            boundless creativity into works that resonate
                            with the depths of the human spirit, inviting
                            others to share in her vision of a world
                            illuminated by wonder and possibility.<br />
                            But your openness extends far beyond the realm
                            of art. You are a seeker of truth, a champion of
                            justice, and a beacon of hope in a world often
                            shrouded in darkness. With courage and
                            conviction, you stand against ignorance and
                            intolerance, embracing diversity and championing
                            the cause of understanding and empathy.<br />
                            For you, life is a grand adventure, a journey of
                            discovery and growth. With every step you take,
                            you embrace the unknown, welcoming the
                            challenges that lie ahead and savoring the
                            moments of wonder and awe that enrich your soul.<br />
                            In you, it can be found a kindred spirit, a soul
                            aflame with the fire of imagination and the
                            light of possibility. With you by our side, we
                            are reminded of the boundless potential that
                            lies within each of us, waiting to be unleashed
                            in a world brimming with beauty, adventure, and
                            endless opportunity.
                        </p>

                        <%} else{%>
                            <p class="description">As a person <b>low in
                                    openness</b>, you are a
                                steadfast
                                soul with a deep appreciation for tradition and
                                familiarity. Rooted in the comfort of routine
                                and the stability of the familiar, you find
                                solace in the rhythms of everyday life.<br />
                                For you, the world is best understood through
                                the lens of the known and the familiar. With a
                                practical mindset and a grounded perspective,
                                you navigate life with a steady hand and a sure
                                footing, finding comfort in the predictability
                                of routine and the certainty of tradition.<br />
                                In a world of endless possibilities and
                                ever-changing landscapes, you seek refuge in the
                                familiar embrace of the known and the
                                predictable. Change may come, but you approach
                                it with caution and deliberation, preferring the
                                safety of the familiar to the uncertainty of the
                                unknown.<br />
                                While others may chase after novelty and
                                adventure, you find contentment in the simple
                                pleasures of everyday life. From the comfort of
                                home to the warmth of cherished routines, you
                                find joy in the familiar rituals that anchor the
                                soul and nourish the spirit.<br />
                                In you, we find a steadfast presence, a rock of
                                stability in a world of constant flux. With
                                unwavering determination and steadfast resolve,
                                you stand as a beacon of reliability and
                                dependability, offering strength and support to
                                those who need it most.<br />
                                For you, life is not about chasing after the
                                unknown or seeking out new horizons.<br /> Instead,
                                it's about finding peace and contentment in the
                                quiet moments, the familiar places, and the
                                cherished memories that make life worth living.<br />
                                In a world that's always changing, you remain a
                                constant, a reassuring presence in a sea of
                                uncertainty. With a heart full of warmth and a
                                spirit of resilience, you remind us of the
                                beauty of simplicity and the power of the
                                familiar in a world that's always changing.

                            </p>

                            <%}%>
                </div>
                <!-- section_5 -->
                <div>
                    <h3 class=" vertical-space">
                        Conscientiousness
                    </h3>
                    <p class="description">
                        Conscientiousness refers to the extent to which
                        individuals are responsible, organized, disciplined,
                        and dependable in their approach to life and work.
                        People high in conscientiousness tend to be
                        diligent, thorough, and reliable in fulfilling their
                        obligations and achieving their goals.
                    </p>
                    <p class="description top-extra-space">
                        Individuals who score <b>high in
                            conscientiousness</b>
                        exhibit several characteristic traits and behaviors
                        that set them apart from those who score lower on
                        this personality dimension. Here are some key
                        aspects of people high in conscientiousness:

                    </p>
                    <ul>
                        <li class="list-item"><b>Responsibility:</b>
                            Conscientious individuals are highly responsible
                            and dependable. They take their commitments and
                            obligations seriously and strive to fulfill them
                            to the best of their abilities. They can be
                            relied upon to follow through on their promises
                            and meet deadlines consistently.</li>
                        <li class="list-item"><b>Organization:</b> People
                            high in conscientiousness tend to be
                            well-organized and disciplined in their approach
                            to tasks and goals. They prioritize planning and
                            structure, which helps them manage their time
                            effectively and achieve their objectives
                            efficiently.</li>
                        <li class="list-item"><b>Self-Discipline:</b>
                            Conscientious individuals possess strong
                            self-discipline and self-control. They are able
                            to resist impulses and temptations that may
                            derail their progress toward their goals. They
                            can delay gratification and stay focused on
                            long-term objectives.</li>
                        <li class="list-item"><b>Persistence:</b>
                            Conscientious individuals are persistent and
                            resilient in the face of challenges. They are
                            willing to put in the effort and perseverance
                            required to overcome obstacles and achieve
                            success. They do not easily give up when faced
                            with setbacks or setbacks.</li>
                        <li class="list-item"><b>Attention to Detail:</b>
                            People high in conscientiousness pay close
                            attention to detail and strive for accuracy and
                            precision in their work. They take care to
                            ensure that tasks are completed thoroughly and
                            meticulously, minimizing errors and
                            oversights.</li>
                        <li class="list-item"><b>Goal Orientation:</b>
                            Conscientious individuals are goal-oriented and
                            proactive in pursuing their objectives. They set
                            clear goals for themselves and develop
                            actionable plans to achieve them. They are
                            motivated by a sense of purpose and direction in
                            their lives.</li>
                        <li class="list-item"><b>Reliability:</b>
                            Conscientious individuals are highly reliable
                            and trustworthy. They value integrity and
                            consistency in their actions and interactions
                            with others. They strive to uphold high
                            standards of ethical conduct and honesty in all
                            aspects of their lives.</li>
                        <li class="list-item"><b>Orderliness:</b> People
                            high in conscientiousness prefer order and
                            structure in their environment. They may
                            maintain tidy and organized spaces, both at home
                            and at work, which reflects their preference for
                            neatness and efficiency.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="description">
                        Overall, conscientiousness is associated with
                        qualities such as responsibility, organization,
                        self-discipline, and persistence. Individuals high
                        in conscientiousness tend to achieve success in
                        various domains of life, including academics,
                        careers, and relationships, due to their diligent
                        and disciplined approach to goal pursuit.
                    </p>
                    <p class="description top-extra-space">
                        Individuals who score <b>low in
                            conscientiousness</b> exhibit certain
                        characteristic traits and behaviors that distinguish
                        them from those who score higher on this personality
                        dimension. Here are some key aspects of people low
                        in conscientiousness:
                    </p>
                    <ul>
                        <li class="list-item"><b>Lack of Organization:</b>
                            People low in conscientiousness tend to be
                            disorganized and less structured in their
                            approach to tasks and responsibilities. They may
                            struggle to prioritize their time effectively
                            and may have difficulty keeping track of
                            deadlines and commitments.</li>
                        <li class="list-item"><b>Impulsivity:</b>
                            Individuals low in conscientiousness are more
                            prone to acting on impulse without considering
                            the long-term consequences of their actions.
                            They may struggle with self-control and may have
                            difficulty resisting immediate gratification or
                            temptation.</li>
                        <li class="list-item"><b>Procrastination:</b> Low
                            conscientiousness individuals often
                            procrastinate and delay taking action on tasks
                            or projects until the last minute. They may find
                            it challenging to initiate tasks and may
                            experience difficulty maintaining momentum and
                            focus over time.</li>
                        <li class="list-item"><b>Lack of Follow-Through:</b>
                            People low in conscientiousness may have
                            difficulty following through on their
                            commitments and completing tasks once they have
                            started them. They may abandon projects
                            prematurely or fail to see them through to
                            completion.</li>
                        <li class="list-item"><b>Forgetfulness:</b> Low
                            conscientiousness individuals may be forgetful
                            and may have difficulty remembering important
                            details or obligations. They may overlook
                            deadlines, appointments, and other
                            responsibilities, leading to disorganization and
                            frustration.</li>
                        <li class="list-item"><b>Carelessness:</b>
                            Individuals low in conscientiousness may be
                            careless and prone to making mistakes due to
                            their lack of attention to detail. They may
                            overlook important details or rush through tasks
                            without thoroughly checking their work.</li>
                        <li class="list-item"><b>Difficulty with Time
                                Management:</b> Low conscientiousness
                            individuals may struggle with time management
                            and may have difficulty estimating how long
                            tasks will take to complete. They may
                            underestimate the time needed to accomplish
                            tasks, leading to scheduling conflicts and
                            missed deadlines.</li>
                        <li class="list-item"><b>Inconsistency:</b> People
                            low in conscientiousness may exhibit
                            inconsistency in their behavior and performance.
                            Their motivation and effort levels may vary
                            depending on their mood, energy level, or
                            external circumstances, leading to unpredictable
                            outcomes.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="description bottom-extra-space">
                        Overall, low conscientiousness is associated with
                        traits such as disorganization, impulsivity,
                        procrastination, and inconsistency. Individuals low
                        in conscientiousness may face challenges in
                        achieving their goals and responsibilities due to
                        their difficulty with self-discipline and time
                        management. However, it's important to note that
                        conscientiousness exists on a continuum, and
                        individuals may exhibit varying levels of
                        conscientiousness in different aspects of their
                        lives.
                    </p>

                    <!-- section-6 -->
                    <div class="chart-container heart-line"> <canvas id="hearthorizontalline1" width="400"></canvas>
                    </div>
                    <!-- section-7 -->
                    <p class="top-extra-space"><b>For you:</b></p>
                    <%if(answer.factor_variant.HC>=answer.factor_variant.LC){%>
                        <p class="description">
                            As a person <b>high in conscientiousness</b>
                            you are dedicated individual with a meticulous
                            approach to life and work. From the moment you wake
                            up each morning, you approach the day with a clear
                            sense of purpose and determination.<br />
                            For you, organization is key. Your meticulously kept
                            planner is filled with tasks and deadlines, each
                            meticulously prioritized and scheduled. You take
                            pride in your ability to manage your time
                            effectively, ensuring that every minute is spent
                            productively and purposefully.<br />
                            Responsibility is at the core of your character.
                            Whether it's meeting project deadlines at work or
                            fulfilling commitments to family and friends, you
                            can always be counted on to follow through with
                            unwavering reliability. You take your obligations
                            seriously and approaches them with a sense of duty
                            and commitment.<br />
                            Your disciplined approach to life extends to every
                            aspect of your being. You maintain a healthy
                            lifestyle, prioritizing regular exercise and
                            nutritious eating habits. You understand the
                            importance of self-care and make time for rest and
                            relaxation amidst his busy schedule.<br />
                            In your professional life, you are a model of
                            efficiency and competence. You tackle tasks with
                            precision and attention to detail, ensuring that
                            every project is completed to the highest standards.
                            Your colleagues admire your work ethic and
                            dependability, knowing that they can always rely on
                            you to deliver exceptional results.<br />
                            But your conscientious nature goes beyond your
                            professional endeavors. You approach relationships
                            with the same level of care and dedication,
                            investing time and effort into nurturing meaningful
                            connections with others. You are a loyal friend and
                            a supportive partner, always willing to lend a
                            listening ear or offer a helping hand.<br />
                            In you, we see a shining example of the power of
                            conscientiousness. Your unwavering commitment to
                            excellence, coupled with your disciplined approach
                            to life, sets you apart as a beacon of reliability
                            and integrity in a world filled with uncertainty.<br />
                            This text highlights the organized, responsible, and
                            dependable nature of someone high in
                            conscientiousness, emphasizing their commitment to
                            excellence and reliability in all aspects of their
                            life.

                        </p>

                        <%} else{%>
                            <p class="description">As a person <b>low in
                                    conscientiousness </b>
                                you are a free-spirited individual with a relaxed
                                approach to life. From the moment you wake up each
                                morning, there's an air of spontaneity and adventure
                                in the air.<br />
                                Structure and routine are not your cup of tea.
                                Instead of meticulously planned schedules, you
                                prefer to go with the flow, embracing the
                                unpredictability of each day with open arms.
                                Deadlines and obligations may come and go, but you
                                take each moment as it comes, finding joy in the
                                simple pleasures of life.<br />
                                Responsibility isn't a word that holds much weight
                                in your vocabulary. While some may thrive on the
                                sense of duty and commitment, you prefer to live in
                                the moment, unencumbered by the weight of
                                expectations and obligations. The freedom to explore
                                and experience life on one's own terms is your
                                guiding principle.<br />
                                Discipline and structure may not be your strong
                                suits, but that doesn't mean there's a lack of
                                passion or purpose. Your journey through life is a
                                colorful tapestry of experiences and adventures,
                                each one adding depth and richness to the
                                story.<br />
                                In the professional realm, your approach may seem
                                unconventional to some. Instead of climbing the
                                corporate ladder, you are drawn to pursuits that
                                offer creativity and flexibility. Whether it's
                                pursuing artistic endeavors or exploring
                                entrepreneurial ventures, your path is guided by
                                passion and intuition rather than conventional
                                notions of success.
                                But beneath your carefree exterior lies a heart of
                                gold. Relationships are cherished, and friendships
                                are valued above all else. While you may not always
                                be the most punctual or reliable, the warmth and
